            "description": {
              "value": "Gleaming flakes of chilling snow fall in a 10-foot burst within 60 feet. Each creature in the area takes 2d4 cold damage with a basic Reflex save against your class DC. The ground in the area is covered in a snow drift, which is difficult terrain.\n\nEach square of the drift lasts until it melts, either naturally or until fire damage is dealt in that square."
